Type: Package
Package: order.relations
Title: Order Relations — Synergetics Abstraction Program
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ed", "Phil", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ed@phosphene.dev"),
    person("Jan", "Ritch-Frel", role = "aut", email = "jan@ind.media"),
    person("Flow", "Feel", role = "aut", comment = "AI platform engineer")
  )
Description: Substrate-free implementations of the synergetics abstraction
    inventory: two-variable systems (tau1*xdot=f, tau2*ydot=g), slaving
    without directionality, adiabatic elimination to the slow manifold,
    bi-exponential relaxation, threshold integration windows, and critical
    slowing down. Design law: every object is stateable with zero
    biological nouns; biology enters only at instantiation via mapping
    tables. Implements the MPI Handoff Blueprint — pure functional
    interfaces with contract validation.
